      "description": "Integration PRs are MicroPython-derived patches sharing the MicroPython MIT licence; the generator injects the full PR list from mbm.toml automatically.\npr/lib-pyusb-windows: lib/micropython-lib: Update pyusb with Windows support.\npr/mkrules-exe-fix: py/mkrules.mk: Allow PROG to be set on the command line for .exe targets.\npr/mkrules-frozen-str: py/mkrules.mk: Make MICROPY_MODULE_FROZEN_STR conditional on compiler.\npr/gc-add-heap: py/modgc: Add gc.add_heap() function for runtime heap expansion.\npr/ports-windows-ffi: ports/windows: Add FFI module support with libffi.\npr/unix-windows-romfs: ports/unix,windows: Add embedded romfs support with auto-mount.\npr/ports-windows-variant-overrides: ports/windows: Allow variant override of common config defines."
